==Battleground==
*10 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 15~45 seconds<sup>450f~1,350f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

